#1. First real quick: I can’t find the data to reproduce Fig10.2 from ggtree extra

https://yulab-smu.top/treedata-book/chapter10.html <https://urldefense.com/v3/__https://yulab-smu.top/treedata-book/chapter10.html__;!!LLK065n_VXAQ!yOhtk5AiFS6zfWi-1L-XuKPGpyn5GzrQD40OvBHJZlGiZO5pKm0u_85juQKPSElx4dA$>

